WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 32

01:39.560 --> 01:42.520
Dad, Leshan has gone mad.
She has simply gone mad.

01:43.120 --> 01:45.160
What a disgrace. What a disgrace!

01:45.240 --> 01:47.840
This shrew is causing trouble again.
Let go of Zhuniang quickly.

01:47.920 --> 01:50.160
If you hit her, I will return the favor.

01:50.240 --> 01:51.760
I won't let you off this time.

01:58.320 --> 02:01.280
Good and evil will eventually be repaid.

02:01.360 --> 02:03.160
Do not rejoice if it arrives late.

02:03.240 --> 02:04.920
But the time has not yet come.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.520
You two,

02:10.600 --> 02:13.120
if you can curb your old ways,

02:13.200 --> 02:15.840
you might be able to cling to life.

02:16.520 --> 02:18.120
If you continue to stir up trouble

02:18.200 --> 02:19.440
and hurt innocent lives,

02:19.520 --> 02:20.720
I will not tolerate this.

02:26.880 --> 02:29.120
Punishing the wicked is exhausting.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.520
Fainting.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.120
- Quick.
- Sister.

02:35.200 --> 02:36.960
- Quick. Didn't you see her fainting?
- Sister.

02:37.040 --> 02:38.480
Quickly carry her back to the room.

02:38.560 --> 02:40.840
Get up quickly, sister.

02:41.760 --> 02:43.480
- Zhuniang, are you alright?
- Sister.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.360
Help her up.

02:45.440 --> 02:47.320
My lady.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.600
Gently.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.680
- Be careful.
- Here.

02:52.760 --> 02:54.000
- Come.
- Son.

02:54.080 --> 02:56.240
Come on.

02:56.320 --> 02:57.760
Could she be possessed?

02:57.840 --> 02:59.960
Mother, now is not the time
to ask questions.

03:00.040 --> 03:01.720
Saving her is urgent.
Summon the physician.

03:02.720 --> 03:04.400
Quick, go.

03:05.840 --> 03:06.920
- Sir.
- What?

03:07.000 --> 03:09.120
They're beating to kill.

03:09.200 --> 03:10.160
What…

03:12.800 --> 03:14.520
What on earth is going on here?

03:15.920 --> 03:18.400
My lord,
a possessed person is no trivial matter.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.440
When it strikes,
one doesn't even recognize family.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.760
It strikes at anyone on sight.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.920
With all her energy exhausted,
she momentarily fainted.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.760
What will she be like
once she wakes up again?

03:25.840 --> 03:27.120
That's still hard to say.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.960
Should we tie her up first?

03:38.560 --> 03:40.120
My lord, we called

03:40.200 --> 03:41.920
- physician Wang for a consultation.
- No need.

03:42.000 --> 03:44.840
Haven't we prepared
the demon-repelling blood?

03:45.520 --> 03:46.720
Bring a bowl of it.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.320
Yes.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.600
I'm certainly not drinking that blood.

04:06.080 --> 04:07.320
You're tricking me.

04:07.400 --> 04:09.280
Aren't you possessed?

04:10.480 --> 04:12.840
Where in this world
are there ghosts and evil spirits?

04:12.920 --> 04:15.960
I'm afraid the most evil thing
is the human heart.

04:18.400 --> 04:19.480
I thought

04:19.560 --> 04:21.400
you were going
to beat up my parents as well.

04:22.440 --> 04:24.240
I'm pretending
to be crazy to punish the evil.

04:24.320 --> 04:25.960
But why beat the elderly without a reason?

04:27.480 --> 04:28.720
My mother said

04:29.240 --> 04:31.920
robbing the rich to help the poor,
that's called a knight-errant.

04:32.560 --> 04:34.600
Bullying the weak, that's called a tyrant.

04:35.960 --> 04:37.680
I'm defiant and fierce,

04:37.760 --> 04:40.520
but also renowned and upright.

04:41.160 --> 04:43.920
Your sister-in-law's hurt people.
Otherwise, why would I beat them?

04:46.600 --> 04:48.880
Tonight is but a minor punishment
for a major admonition.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.560
Once I seize ironclad evidence of murder,

04:51.680 --> 04:53.840
I'll send it
to the Kaifeng Court for prosecution.

04:53.920 --> 04:56.200
By then, you won't be able to stop it.

04:57.160 --> 04:59.400
My second sister
is the most acerbic and narrow-minded.

04:59.480 --> 05:01.400
Having been beaten, would she let you off?

05:03.000 --> 05:05.640
Meet force with force. When water comes,
pile on dirt to keep it out.

05:08.280 --> 05:10.640
There's nothing wrong,
yet you still cling to my bed.

05:11.480 --> 05:13.800
What, you can't bear to leave?

05:14.520 --> 05:15.480
You wish.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.520
Just wait.

05:21.600 --> 05:24.280
When my sister gets up tomorrow,

05:24.360 --> 05:27.440
she'll definitely incite Mother
to teach you a lesson.

05:44.160 --> 05:46.800
How dare she
openly beat her sister-in-law?

05:46.880 --> 05:48.400
Causing such a commotion

05:48.480 --> 05:50.840
and still have the face
to run back to her parents' house.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.760
You go pull her down for me.

05:53.440 --> 05:56.560
I'll give her a couple of slaps
to see if she dares to fight back.

05:56.640 --> 05:59.720
Please calm your anger. It's taboo
to scold a daughter-in-law in public.

05:59.800 --> 06:03.160
You don't want to be gossiped about,
or lose your dignity.

06:03.240 --> 06:05.880
We can only persuade her
with kind words to turn back.

06:05.960 --> 06:07.920
Once the family door is shut,
act as one pleases.

06:08.000 --> 06:10.320
Not afraid that she'll fly
out of the palm of your hand.

06:11.280 --> 06:12.280
You go.

06:12.840 --> 06:15.120
Just say that I have a couple
of important words to entrust.

06:15.200 --> 06:16.480
Ask her to come down nicely.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.720
Her domineering spirit

06:18.800 --> 06:20.520
is truly rare in the world.

06:20.600 --> 06:23.120
We servants are likely unable
to dissuade her.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.240
Timid as a mouse.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.400
I will go myself.

06:28.480 --> 06:29.840
I'd like to see her try to shirk.

06:46.400 --> 06:47.800
- Li Leshan.
- Go.

06:51.400 --> 06:52.440
Stop.

06:52.520 --> 06:53.680
Where are we going?

06:53.760 --> 06:55.160
Quick, call someone to chase!

07:00.400 --> 07:02.560
I am your mother-in-law.

07:03.280 --> 07:07.040
If you dare to act rashly, family rules
and moral norms won't spare you.

07:07.120 --> 07:09.080
Mother-in-law, don't be afraid.

07:09.160 --> 07:11.840
Although I'm from a humble family,
I know the hierarchical order.

07:12.480 --> 07:14.280
I rashly schemed to have you come here.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.520
I have my own reasons.

07:16.120 --> 07:19.440
Once you arrive at the place
you will understand everything.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.840
What kind of place is this?

07:45.920 --> 07:47.320
So cramped and narrow.

07:47.920 --> 07:50.000
The smell of horse urine
and cow dung is everywhere.

07:50.080 --> 07:51.200
The carriage almost stalled.

07:52.080 --> 07:53.440
What do you want me to see?

07:53.520 --> 07:54.840
And we've been waiting so long.

07:56.560 --> 07:57.680
It's here.

08:07.320 --> 08:10.360
Indeed, one corpse and two lives.
The evidence is irrefutable.

08:10.440 --> 08:12.760
They should take the corpse
to the court for confirmation.

08:12.840 --> 08:14.880
Only then can they console
the soul of the daughter.

08:15.960 --> 08:17.520
Imagine if it were commoners

08:17.600 --> 08:20.320
without wealth or power, they wouldn't
dare to report to the officials.

08:22.080 --> 08:23.560
This is quite strange, indeed.

08:24.160 --> 08:28.160
The Zhang family, without wealth or power,
dare confront the Yangs for wrongdoing.

08:28.960 --> 08:30.640
Leaving Yinping's corpse,

08:30.720 --> 08:33.240
isn't it just the right way
to ask for more funeral expenses?

08:33.320 --> 08:34.480
Why a midnight burial?

08:35.560 --> 08:38.120
Unless she took someone else's money

08:38.840 --> 08:40.000
and intentionally framed Yang…

08:41.440 --> 08:42.720
my husband.

08:42.800 --> 08:46.000
They also fear that the authorities will
investigate and the truth will be exposed.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.240
That's why it was secret.

08:52.240 --> 08:55.800
YANG MANSION

08:58.040 --> 08:59.560
Slow down.

09:01.720 --> 09:02.880
- Careful.
- Ah!

09:11.920 --> 09:14.200
Li Leshan, you dare to come back.

09:14.280 --> 09:17.440
We've searched all over Bianjing
and also inquired at Sifu House.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.760
Where have you hidden my mother?

09:19.840 --> 09:21.240
If you don't tell the truth,

09:21.320 --> 09:23.360
don't blame me
for taking it to your Li family.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.360
You are really muddled in your actions.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.800
My mother is your mother-in-law.

09:27.880 --> 09:29.400
A transgression
to a superior is an offense.

09:29.480 --> 09:32.200
Upon investigation, no one
in your Li family can escape involvement.

09:32.800 --> 09:34.040
Hurry up and explain.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.800
It will also save us
from a major conflict.

09:40.080 --> 09:41.760
Mother-in-law, please step out.

09:45.680 --> 09:46.560
Mother.

09:47.720 --> 09:49.920
Mother, you…

09:54.080 --> 09:55.520
It's too stuffy inside the house.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.720
I asked my daughter-in-law
to accompany me for a walk.

09:58.640 --> 09:59.720
Don't make a fuss over it.

10:00.400 --> 10:01.600
Disperse now.

10:05.360 --> 10:08.720
Mother, I have been worried
about you all day.

10:08.800 --> 10:10.040
Mother.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.120
Li Leshan.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.920
What kind of spell
did you cast on my mother?

10:19.560 --> 10:22.880
My lord's injuries haven't healed.
I must return to attend to him.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.280
I must take my leave first.

10:30.680 --> 10:32.920
What exactly has Li Leshan done?

10:33.000 --> 10:35.160
She's charmed Mother so much
her speech has changed.

10:36.040 --> 10:38.080
I've really underestimated her.

10:38.160 --> 10:40.880
This demoness.
She's brewed a potent enchantment potion.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.520
Even Mother has been deceived by her.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.480
- Quick, it's killing me.
- Come on.

10:46.560 --> 10:48.040
Quickly help me back.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.320
- It's Li Leshan's fault.
- Ouch.

10:50.440 --> 10:51.560
Slow down.

10:53.880 --> 10:55.320
My mother really believed your words?

10:56.000 --> 10:57.480
Of course.

10:57.560 --> 10:59.360
Seeing is believing. How could she not?

11:02.080 --> 11:03.920
Ever since I came of age,

11:04.000 --> 11:06.840
I've only seen her bickering
with the concubines every day.

11:07.520 --> 11:10.400
Competing over prestige,
dignity, and sons,

11:10.480 --> 11:12.080
as if there's nothing else worth doing.

11:13.400 --> 11:15.000
I'm her underachieving son.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.680
Can't bring her any honor.

11:16.760 --> 11:18.600
Instead, I cause discord
between the parents.

11:19.280 --> 11:22.440
Though she defends me verbally,
in her heart, resentment is inevitable.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.520
And others add fuel
to the fire with their words,

11:25.600 --> 11:28.120
as if all the evils
of the world are my doing.

11:28.200 --> 11:30.240
That's because
of your unyielding and unruly nature.

11:30.320 --> 11:32.640
Your actions give others
the opportunity to falsely accuse you.

11:33.720 --> 11:36.120
But that's my own business.
No need for you to meddle.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.360
I've arranged for men
to lie in ambush at the cemetery.

11:43.440 --> 11:45.400
I've discussed it
with your mother already.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.960
Should we capture Zhang's family
and hand them to the authorities

11:48.040 --> 11:51.040
to charge them
with the crime of extortion?

11:51.120 --> 11:52.600
Guess what your mother said?

11:56.000 --> 11:57.080
I really don't want to know.

12:00.800 --> 12:04.520
She said, "Tomorrow, deliver a generous
gift to the Zhang family to appease them.

12:05.280 --> 12:07.440
Give Yinping a proper burial
and put the matter to rest."

12:07.520 --> 12:10.120
Turning someone in to the authorities
would certainly be satisfying.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.720
But it's inevitable
that others will still criticize you

12:12.800 --> 12:14.480
for coercing a servant girl

12:14.560 --> 12:15.880
and for driving her to her death.

12:17.160 --> 12:19.840
Although your mother is misled,
she does truly care about you.

12:21.760 --> 12:23.200
She's not doing it for me.

12:23.280 --> 12:25.520
She's afraid of people saying
the Yangs abuse their power

12:25.600 --> 12:26.760
and oppresses the common folk.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.200
Li Leshan,

12:29.280 --> 12:32.400
you've been pulling effort
and carefully planning for me.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.480
You couldn't possibly
have changed your mind,

12:34.560 --> 12:36.480
intending to stay
and become my wife, right?

12:37.480 --> 12:38.640
What are you trying to do?

12:43.480 --> 12:44.880
Leshan,

12:45.560 --> 12:47.400
you've worked hard to exonerate Xian.

12:48.040 --> 12:49.000
What do you want?

12:52.160 --> 12:55.840
My mother often says since ancient times,
families who rise through meanness

12:55.920 --> 12:57.600
never enjoy lasting wealth and honor.

12:57.680 --> 12:59.520
When children and grandchildren
are rebellious,

12:59.600 --> 13:01.160
they'll reap what they sowed.

13:01.240 --> 13:03.280
Now that I'm married into the Yang family,

13:03.360 --> 13:05.600
firstly, I want harmony
throughout the Yang family

13:05.680 --> 13:06.840
and a legacy of integrity.

13:06.920 --> 13:09.640
Secondly, I want my husband
to have a change of heart and start anew

13:09.720 --> 13:10.840
to become a better person.

13:12.240 --> 13:15.400
Changing his stubborn nature?
You're dreaming.

13:16.560 --> 13:19.200
If he could change,
not to mention tolerating you a little,

13:19.280 --> 13:23.040
I'd even set up an ancestral tablet
for you to ensure your long life

13:23.120 --> 13:26.360
and willingly burn incense
three times a day for you.

13:26.440 --> 13:28.400
Once in my hands,

13:28.480 --> 13:30.440
let alone flesh and blood,

13:30.520 --> 13:32.200
even the straight and strong poplars,

13:32.280 --> 13:34.840
if I say bend, they will bend.
They will do whatever I say.

13:35.720 --> 13:36.800
However,

13:38.720 --> 13:40.840
I still have to ask you for something.

13:41.600 --> 13:44.160
Without it, I can't deal with him.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.160
What thing?

13:47.680 --> 13:49.480
I want the power to lead the Yang family.

13:50.240 --> 13:53.400
I want that Gold Master Seal
in your hands.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.760
From today on,

13:59.840 --> 14:02.280
without the gold seal in my hand,

14:02.360 --> 14:04.600
even if you have
tens of thousands in wealth,

14:04.680 --> 14:06.920
you won't be able to get a coin
from the accounting house.

14:07.000 --> 14:09.640
Yet more ragged
than the beggars at the street corner.

14:10.760 --> 14:12.920
Li Leshan, you've got quite the nerve.

14:14.000 --> 14:15.120
What?

14:31.640 --> 14:32.640
My lord.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.680
Leave.

14:38.320 --> 14:40.920
Can't order you around anymore? Get out.

14:41.000 --> 14:42.320
Have someone else come in.

14:42.400 --> 14:43.560
Why are you scolding him?

14:44.160 --> 14:46.280
You're eating less, looking all gloomy.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.280
And the bone injury
is taking so long to heal.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.560
We rely on him for everything.

14:49.640 --> 14:51.600
It's rash to replace him
with someone else.

14:51.680 --> 14:53.320
Where can we find someone
as handy as him?

14:54.240 --> 14:57.320
In that case, have the accountant
lift the ban, and I'll take my medicine.

15:00.280 --> 15:02.440
- Just put it there.
- Yes.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.560
My lord, time for your medicine.

15:32.760 --> 15:33.880
- Just…
- Take the medicine.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.000
It suits both of us.

15:36.840 --> 15:38.080
Wait until I'm fully recovered,

15:38.800 --> 15:41.280
- then we'll settle accounts.
- All right, all right.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.880
Once your legs are better,

15:42.960 --> 15:45.000
you'll feel the force
of my gold pod again.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.160
I'd rather die than drink it.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.160
- Drink or not?
- I won't drink.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.240
My lord.

15:54.280 --> 15:56.160
My lord, my lady,
the Li family has sent someone.

15:56.840 --> 15:58.880
- Have them come in quickly.
- Yes.

16:00.680 --> 16:03.200
- Madam, my wife is bullying--
- Shut up.

16:05.520 --> 16:08.240
Cutting off the source of your
financial disaster is for your own good.

16:09.280 --> 16:10.480
Madam.

16:10.560 --> 16:12.480
You're driving me crazy.

16:12.560 --> 16:14.960
Shut up, no talking.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.600
You may not speak.

16:26.480 --> 16:27.880
How come it's you?

16:31.080 --> 16:32.880
It seems we have come
at an inconvenient time.

16:35.840 --> 16:38.680
Mother knows the fifth brother-in-law
loves her candied meat buns.

16:38.760 --> 16:40.840
She rendered the lard
in the third watch of the night.

16:40.920 --> 16:43.360
These two baskets are freshly steamed,
fragrant and sweet.

16:43.440 --> 16:46.400
She wanted to deliver them personally,
but really couldn't leave the shop.

16:46.480 --> 16:49.160
She also insisted I bring some
winter melons and eggplants

16:49.240 --> 16:50.560
from the Chai family homestead.

16:50.640 --> 16:53.880
I said the Yang family is very wealthy.
There's nothing good they haven't seen.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.760
She said those are fresh crops
from the field.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.760
Even the palace
can't get such fresh produce.

16:58.680 --> 16:59.800
By the way,

16:59.880 --> 17:02.240
she let me check on you

17:02.320 --> 17:04.840
to see if you are bullying
your husband again.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.040
Yes, yes, yes.

17:06.120 --> 17:07.360
No, no, no.

17:11.720 --> 17:13.320
Just kidding.

17:13.400 --> 17:15.800
It's nice Madam thinks of me,
and I have her on my mind too.

17:15.880 --> 17:18.560
The crab roe buns
made by our chef taste extremely good.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.160
It's famous in Bianjing.

17:20.240 --> 17:23.200
I had him make several more boxes to share
with my mother-in-law and sisters.

17:23.880 --> 17:27.040
A friend of mine will also bring some
fresh cherries and golden apricots.

17:27.120 --> 17:29.840
If you don't mind,
stay here a couple more days

17:29.920 --> 17:32.400
- and take them all back for me.
- No, that won't do.

17:37.080 --> 17:38.080
Qiongnu,

17:38.160 --> 17:40.320
the shop can't do without you
even for a moment.

17:40.400 --> 17:42.480
But when coming here, Mom said

17:43.040 --> 17:46.360
the Yang family
has a big and beautiful garden

17:46.440 --> 17:48.800
filled with all sorts
of exotic flowers and plants.

17:48.880 --> 17:51.440
She asked you to show me around properly.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.880
There's no rush to go back.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.920
What's there to admire in the garden?

17:56.000 --> 17:59.240
It's because she's afraid I'll bully
Yang Xian, sending you to watch me.

17:59.320 --> 18:00.880
Good that you are aware of it.

18:09.440 --> 18:10.840
Still annoyed?

18:10.920 --> 18:12.560
I have something serious to tell you.

18:18.440 --> 18:19.480
Leave us.

18:22.200 --> 18:23.680
Mom asked me to pass on a message.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.440
It was his fault at the beginning.

18:26.520 --> 18:27.520
No wonder you resent him.

18:27.600 --> 18:30.280
But now that the bridal palanquin
has entered the Yang family's gate,

18:30.360 --> 18:32.280
everyone acknowledges you two
as husband and wife.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.520
Like nails hammered into stone,

18:34.600 --> 18:36.280
it can never be changed again.

18:36.360 --> 18:37.720
This incessant arguing,

18:37.800 --> 18:41.280
is it pleasing to the eye or to the ear?
Don't give others something to talk about.

18:41.360 --> 18:44.520
Did I snatch a bridal palanquin,
forcibly took someone's wife,

18:44.600 --> 18:46.520
or act lawlessly?

18:47.400 --> 18:48.640
Act upright, sit straight.

18:48.720 --> 18:51.400
Being fair to the heavens.
I'm not afraid of being talked about.

18:54.040 --> 18:55.200
Disobedient.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.800
Beating the husband, scolding
the sisters-in-law, just name it.

18:58.880 --> 19:00.360
Behind our backs, people curse Mother.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.960
They will blame Mom
for not teaching her daughter well,

19:03.040 --> 19:04.400
allowing a domineering daughter.

19:10.080 --> 19:13.000
I'm begging you.

19:13.080 --> 19:15.680
For the sake of our mother
and the reputation of the Li family,

19:16.280 --> 19:17.440
be nicer to your husband.

19:19.240 --> 19:22.360
When I see him, it reminds me of the
forced marriage and kidnapping incident.

19:22.440 --> 19:23.760
I'm so angry I could hit him.

19:25.720 --> 19:28.080
You may not be fond of him,
but he sure fancies you.

19:28.760 --> 19:30.320
You hated him and got physical.

19:30.400 --> 19:32.160
Did he fight back, for even a little?

19:32.840 --> 19:35.520
If you don't believe me,
just try showing him some kindness once.

19:35.600 --> 19:36.840
It would make him overjoyed.

19:42.720 --> 19:43.920
Alright, alright.

19:44.000 --> 19:46.400
Forget about it. The boring talks
make me impatient.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.760
Don't you just love pearls?

19:48.840 --> 19:50.400
I've just acquired a new pearl crown.

19:50.480 --> 19:52.240
It was a gift from Lady Jieyu
from the palace.

19:52.320 --> 19:54.280
I'll have someone bring it.
Let's both admire it.

19:54.360 --> 19:56.600
You sure are stubborn.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.280
Here, eat this.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.520
Leshan.

20:15.600 --> 20:17.000
So, your leg healed a while ago

20:17.680 --> 20:19.720
and yet you dared
to sneak out for hunting.

20:21.040 --> 20:22.960
It seems you've been
hiding some personal savings.

20:23.040 --> 20:25.120
That doesn't give you the right
to plot against your husband.

20:46.600 --> 20:48.800
I just checked the ledger yesterday.

20:48.880 --> 20:51.040
You, Master Yang,
live a life of luxury and wealth.

20:51.120 --> 20:54.040
All your expenses go to hosting banquets,
frolicking, and hunting.

20:54.120 --> 20:56.440
You spend thousands of gold
in a single month.

20:56.520 --> 20:58.720
Only to entertain a few worthless fellows.

20:58.800 --> 21:01.240
Even dogs are more loyal
than those few scoundrels and cronies.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.080
I saw through it long ago.

21:06.600 --> 21:08.120
Yang Xian, you are no fool.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.680
Indulging in pleasures,
you've given up on yourself.

21:10.760 --> 21:12.600
In this family,
who actually cares about you?

21:17.560 --> 21:18.600
You…

21:20.840 --> 21:22.840
There is no one in the Yang family
that I care about.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.920
Who am I supposed to impress?

21:25.400 --> 21:28.240
Unless my lady takes pity
and agrees to be my true wife.

21:28.320 --> 21:30.360
Someday, I will earn
a noble title for my lady.

21:30.440 --> 21:31.600
And that would only be right.

21:34.840 --> 21:37.440
I never expected that in my lord's heart,

21:37.520 --> 21:38.640
I would hold such a position.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.600
My lady is willing to help me
to this extent.

21:51.680 --> 21:52.920
Such great kindness.

21:53.000 --> 21:55.280
I should certainly return the favor.

21:55.360 --> 21:56.800
At my lady's service.

22:05.000 --> 22:07.000
If you want me to be your wife,

22:07.080 --> 22:09.720
have you exchanged betrothal gifts
or set a wedding date?

22:09.800 --> 22:12.720
The Yang family hasn't offered a bride
price nor completed any formalities.

22:12.800 --> 22:14.600
You haven't offered incense
at the temple.

22:14.680 --> 22:17.440
Without a proper name and declaration,
how do you claim to be married?

22:18.120 --> 22:20.360
I have an imperial gold plaque,
a match made in heaven.

22:21.360 --> 22:23.840
- You.
- Beat as you will.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.960
Rascal.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.520
Luckily, I was prepared in advance.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.880
Even when Mr. Du
seeks to marry my eldest sister,

22:40.960 --> 22:42.520
he must first pass the three challenges.

22:42.600 --> 22:45.280
This is my family's tradition.

22:45.360 --> 22:47.600
I'm afraid that even if
I pass 30 challenges,

22:48.240 --> 22:50.440
someone will still turn their back on me.

22:51.600 --> 22:53.400
You really want to ask
for my hand in marriage?

22:57.600 --> 22:59.520
My third sister
once asked her husband to swear,

23:00.400 --> 23:03.520
if the wife has a short life and the
couple is forever separated by death,

23:04.280 --> 23:06.760
the husband must mourn for three years
before he may remarry.

23:07.920 --> 23:09.520
I'm more overbearing than my sisters.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.680
If I die first,

23:11.760 --> 23:13.480
I'll take
my husband's possessions with me.

23:16.440 --> 23:18.600
Even if it means burning them to ashes,

23:18.680 --> 23:20.560
I will not share
a single penny with others.

23:22.000 --> 23:25.120
If you are dead and buried in the evening,
I'll bury myself at midnight to follow.

23:25.200 --> 23:27.000
Once a promise is made,
it's unbreakable as stone.

23:27.080 --> 23:29.280
We'll clap hands as an oath
and never go back on our words.

23:30.240 --> 23:33.960
Good. I swear by the moon,

23:34.880 --> 23:37.160
if you truly can pass
the three challenges,

23:37.240 --> 23:39.200
then I am willing to commit
my entire life to you.

23:39.280 --> 23:41.920
If I break the promise
and the oath, punish me

23:42.640 --> 23:45.360
to be abandoned by everyone,
as a lifelong widow.

23:51.240 --> 23:54.200
I don't trust you unless

23:55.160 --> 23:56.080
you sleep in my bed.

24:00.440 --> 24:02.400
The couple sleeps on separate beds.

24:02.480 --> 24:04.760
Mother will ask and the servants gossip.

24:05.440 --> 24:07.400
It wouldn't be good if Mother-in-law
knows it.

24:23.640 --> 24:26.320
Without passing the three challenges,
we are not husband and wife yet.

24:26.400 --> 24:28.080
We'll live with borders, like Chu and Han.

24:28.840 --> 24:31.680
Dare encroach the slightest bit,
and you shall be dead.

24:32.520 --> 24:33.600
Go to sleep.

25:25.800 --> 25:26.760
My lady.

25:27.920 --> 25:30.640
My lady,
where are you going so late at night?

25:30.720 --> 25:31.920
To admire the moon.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.840
He is putting on an act everywhere,

25:44.920 --> 25:46.320
seeking to win my pity.

25:47.280 --> 25:49.160
I shouldn't agree
to these three challenges.

25:49.240 --> 25:50.440
What if he…

25:50.520 --> 25:52.360
Do I really have to marry him?

25:56.880 --> 25:59.400
- Don't worry.
- You are of no use.

25:59.480 --> 26:01.560
When will we finally
get rid of that calamity?

26:01.640 --> 26:02.600
Who's there?

26:05.440 --> 26:06.440
My lady.

26:07.240 --> 26:08.200
My lady, slow down.

26:11.880 --> 26:13.280
I'll just go get a lantern.

26:13.360 --> 26:14.520
My lady, you walk too fast.

26:29.280 --> 26:30.200
This…

26:30.880 --> 26:33.840
I don't know who this shameless one is,
tarnishing my lady's discerning eyes.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.440
Tomorrow, I'll report to the mistress.

26:35.520 --> 26:37.640
The golden crow accompanies
the laurels of the moon.

26:38.240 --> 26:40.240
The sun and the moon vie for radiance.

26:41.600 --> 26:43.600
What great ambition and spirit.

26:44.560 --> 26:45.840
This embroidery pattern is rare.

26:46.440 --> 26:48.240
The needlework skill is also uncommon.

26:52.000 --> 26:54.680
Don't act rashly and alert the enemy.
Keep it well.

26:54.760 --> 26:55.600
Yes.

26:58.480 --> 27:00.360
Things will eventually
sort themselves out.

27:00.440 --> 27:01.800
What's there to worry about?

27:02.440 --> 27:04.440
Set the exam questions
to be extremely difficult.

27:04.520 --> 27:06.320
Let him know it's difficult and withdraw.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.760
Lion dance?

27:09.840 --> 27:11.600
Before the dragon boat race each year,

27:11.680 --> 27:14.560
there's always a lion dance contest
for the top prize.

27:14.640 --> 27:16.920
For the winner, the emperor
grant positions and bestows gold.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.080
It's truly a splendid sight.

27:18.920 --> 27:21.600
If you win first place,
then you've passed the first challenge.

27:27.120 --> 27:29.640
Lion dance to grab the prize? It can't be.

27:30.360 --> 27:31.400
It's true.

27:31.480 --> 27:34.080
Your good brother
is recruiting capable people,

27:34.160 --> 27:36.600
eager to win in the Lion King contest.

27:37.320 --> 27:39.840
It must be that shrew instigating trouble.

27:40.560 --> 27:43.080
Mom has become indifferent recently

27:43.160 --> 27:44.400
and neglected everything.

27:47.560 --> 27:50.320
I heard that shrew
took over Mom's Gold Master Seal

27:50.400 --> 27:53.040
and wants to thoroughly check
the account books of these past years.

27:53.120 --> 27:55.560
What if she discovers your doings
these few years?

27:55.640 --> 27:56.760
What should we do?

27:58.120 --> 28:01.200
Rest assured. The accounts I've done,

28:01.280 --> 28:03.000
ordinary people can't spot anything amiss.

28:03.680 --> 28:05.680
Let alone every Dragon Boat Festival,

28:06.360 --> 28:08.280
Jinming Pool attracts experts.

28:08.360 --> 28:10.520
Dangers lurk everywhere.

28:10.600 --> 28:11.920
Picking the top prize isn't easy.

28:13.560 --> 28:15.400
Even if a few people die,

28:16.120 --> 28:17.600
it's not surprising.

28:18.720 --> 28:20.880
No way. After all, he is my own brother.

28:21.640 --> 28:22.560
Even if I dislike him,

28:22.640 --> 28:24.520
I'll just find a way to drive him out.

28:25.640 --> 28:28.160
Taking lives over money matters

28:28.800 --> 28:29.640
is unacceptable.

28:29.720 --> 28:31.520
Where is your mind going?

28:31.600 --> 28:33.640
It's just to teach him a lesson or two

28:34.440 --> 28:35.680
to dispel your resentment.

28:36.360 --> 28:38.920
Make them obedient in the future.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.520
Also let the couple

28:40.600 --> 28:42.360
learn their lessons.

28:42.960 --> 28:46.280
It's not yet their turn
to be in charge of the Yang family.

29:00.640 --> 29:01.800
Good plan.

29:02.640 --> 29:04.800
Also, a good way to deal with that shrew.

29:05.840 --> 29:06.920
Intimidate and subdue her.

29:10.320 --> 29:12.400
My good wife.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.200
You're really smart.

29:28.080 --> 29:29.040
Stand firm.

30:06.800 --> 30:08.120
Be careful.

30:23.280 --> 30:24.320
My lord, be careful.

30:28.400 --> 30:31.360
That prize is hung high. It's nothing like
the lion dance on the ground.

30:32.040 --> 30:33.080
Make sure you stay stable.

30:33.760 --> 30:36.240
If one falls from a high place,
at least it will cause fractures.

30:36.800 --> 30:38.320
At worst, it could be life-threatening.

30:38.400 --> 30:39.840
Be extremely careful.

30:40.520 --> 30:41.760
When my grandfather was alive,

30:41.840 --> 30:43.840
I performed a lion dance for his birthday.

30:44.880 --> 30:46.680
I must lack practice.

30:48.600 --> 30:50.480
- Again.
- Come on.

30:50.560 --> 30:53.240
Brother Yang.

30:54.320 --> 30:56.360
I've just returned

30:56.440 --> 30:58.080
and I hear you're risking your life here.

30:58.160 --> 30:59.680
Don't make everyone worried.

30:59.760 --> 31:03.080
They say that Li Leshan is fierce
like a tiger and cruel like a wolf.

31:03.160 --> 31:05.880
Cold-hearted and malicious,
a match for a demon.

31:05.960 --> 31:08.040
What has bewitched your senses?

31:08.120 --> 31:10.160
Not to mention
she plays you around every day.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.640
You still treat her like a treasure.

31:11.720 --> 31:13.400
For such a violent woman,

31:13.480 --> 31:15.240
it's not worth risking your life.

31:16.720 --> 31:18.320
- Let's continue.
- Okay.

31:19.480 --> 31:23.040
She is probably fooling you around
and will not truly keep her word.

31:23.120 --> 31:24.760
When the Dragon Boat Festival comes,

31:24.840 --> 31:27.200
all the people in Bianjing
will come to watch the contest.

31:27.280 --> 31:29.360
Surrounded by such a crowd,

31:29.440 --> 31:31.920
if you really lose,
it will be a great embarrassment.

31:32.000 --> 31:34.480
Yang, slow down.

31:35.280 --> 31:37.840
Aren't you afraid of heights?

31:40.640 --> 31:42.080
Dare slander Leshan again,

31:42.160 --> 31:43.120
I'll crush your tongue.

31:44.880 --> 31:46.600
- Continue.
- Slow down.

31:47.560 --> 31:49.280
Qiansheng,
why don't you try to persuade him?

31:49.360 --> 31:50.440
Enough said.

31:50.520 --> 31:52.600
He's gone mad, truly mad.

31:52.680 --> 31:55.440
Slow down.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.280
Be careful.

32:00.000 --> 32:01.840
Sort out this mugwort carefully.

32:08.960 --> 32:10.000
My lady.

32:11.520 --> 32:12.600
It's almost dusk.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.520
Your husband has not returned home yet.

32:15.440 --> 32:16.800
Yes.

32:19.360 --> 32:20.360
Why are you looking at me?

32:21.760 --> 32:22.880
My lady.

32:22.960 --> 32:24.720
The Lord is in fear of heights
from childhood.

32:25.400 --> 32:27.640
I'm afraid he is not suited
for the contest.

32:35.600 --> 32:37.200
- Take it to him.
- Yes.

32:37.280 --> 32:39.080
These are the corn dumplings
my mother made.

32:39.880 --> 32:40.880
Do not mention me in this.

32:46.080 --> 32:47.520
Nor are you allowed to look at me.

32:59.000 --> 33:01.480
Try the perilla drink I brewed at home.
Sir, please have a taste.

33:01.560 --> 33:03.200
Fresh pastries on sale.

33:03.280 --> 33:05.080
My lady, the iced beverage I've brewed.

33:05.160 --> 33:06.280
Would you like to try?

33:06.360 --> 33:07.440
They're all very tasty.

33:07.520 --> 33:09.760
- Come and have a taste.
- Don't be in a hurry.

33:09.840 --> 33:11.280
- Come, come.
- Why is it built so high?

33:31.280 --> 33:32.440
Too overconfident.

33:32.520 --> 33:33.440
Absolutely not.

33:33.520 --> 33:34.520
What is this?

33:34.600 --> 33:35.680
He is just a porcelain vase.

33:35.760 --> 33:37.920
- Just for show.
- Exactly.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.480
How could he possibly win?

33:39.560 --> 33:41.280
Look at my foolish brother.

33:41.360 --> 33:43.640
Always causing trouble

33:43.720 --> 33:45.160
on normal days.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.960
There are no outsiders here today.

33:48.040 --> 33:49.400
There's nothing that can't be said.

33:50.120 --> 33:51.760
I have no idea

33:51.840 --> 33:53.760
who incited him,

33:53.840 --> 33:56.200
making a fuss about
joining the Lion King Festival.

33:56.280 --> 33:58.440
And he's making a big show of it,

33:58.520 --> 34:00.480
making it known
to everyone with his clamor.

34:00.560 --> 34:02.600
Over these years,

34:02.680 --> 34:05.320
those who have won the prize
are all brave warriors.

34:06.280 --> 34:07.280
It's not his turn at all.

34:08.440 --> 34:09.280
Just look.

34:09.360 --> 34:11.720
They've all come to witness
the joke of our Yang family.

34:11.800 --> 34:13.680
No wonder Father hasn't come.

34:13.760 --> 34:16.000
It would embarrass me to death.

34:20.400 --> 34:21.840
Can't believe they're a family.

34:22.840 --> 34:24.160
When the brother is in the arena,

34:24.240 --> 34:26.840
they don't cheer for him,

34:26.920 --> 34:28.640
but they discourage and mock.

34:28.720 --> 34:30.920
Is she really his sister?

34:31.000 --> 34:32.680
Poor man.

34:37.440 --> 34:40.400
Look, someone from the palace
has come too.

34:46.960 --> 34:50.160
GENEROUS AND KIND

35:03.000 --> 35:05.080
Yesterday, Uncle specially
visited my second cousin,

35:05.160 --> 35:07.320
earnestly advising him not to go.

35:08.640 --> 35:11.960
Turns out it's because
His Majesty came in person.

35:20.480 --> 35:23.080
Alright, now, we will

35:23.160 --> 35:25.040
embarrass ourselves
in front of the royal family.

35:25.120 --> 35:27.120
My presumptuous dear brother.

35:27.200 --> 35:29.360
If this turns out to be a complete defeat,

35:29.440 --> 35:31.520
on the face of Jieyu,

35:31.600 --> 35:32.680
there will be no glory.

35:34.280 --> 35:35.360
That's enough.

35:35.960 --> 35:37.640
Nobody is allowed
to speak dishearteningly.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.040
What's the matter with you?

35:49.120 --> 35:50.960
It's no good.

35:51.040 --> 35:52.920
- What's happened?
- I have a stomachache.

35:53.440 --> 35:54.560
Stomachache.

35:54.640 --> 35:57.080
Such a critical moment.
How did you end up with a bad stomach?

35:57.160 --> 35:58.680
Right, if you leave, what do we do?

35:58.760 --> 36:01.200
Even if it's the last thing you do,
you have to hold on for me.

36:01.280 --> 36:03.920
Otherwise, at this time, where will I find
a drummer in such a hurry?

36:04.000 --> 36:07.000
The lion dance contest needs a drummer.
The momentum can't be weak.

36:07.080 --> 36:08.760
Yeah, if you leave, who will cheer for us?

36:09.600 --> 36:11.200
Can't do it.

36:12.520 --> 36:13.840
It's not going to work.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.560
What can we do about this?

36:17.240 --> 36:18.240
This…

36:20.080 --> 36:21.120
What should we do?

36:22.680 --> 36:25.120
It's already this late.
Where are you going?

36:27.040 --> 36:28.120
Xian.

36:29.480 --> 36:31.000
Follow me.

36:36.200 --> 36:38.680
Xian, that pole is high.

36:38.760 --> 36:39.840
It makes my heart tremble.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.880
You can't go.

36:41.480 --> 36:44.040
Go and see what's going on.

36:48.360 --> 36:51.000
What? Let me do it?

36:52.120 --> 36:53.080
What's wrong?

36:53.160 --> 36:55.000
You wield your staff with divine skill.

36:55.080 --> 36:56.720
Are you scared to switch to drumsticks?

36:56.800 --> 36:58.080
Why wouldn't I dare?

37:00.760 --> 37:02.080
It's just that…

37:04.040 --> 37:07.960
Showing off in front of a big crowd,
it's not proper for a lady.

37:08.040 --> 37:10.000
The Yang family
will have trouble with you again.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.680
Xian, not just anyone
can replace the drummer.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.360
Stop causing a scene
and being a laughingstock.

37:15.440 --> 37:16.680
Let's go.

37:18.720 --> 37:21.240
I don't need a drummer.
I just want you to watch me win.

37:22.280 --> 37:25.200
Li Leshan, you are
a woman of valor, a true heroine.

37:25.280 --> 37:27.840
I love your candid and bold character,
unrestrained and unbridled.

37:28.440 --> 37:30.240
Go if you want. Why fear others' gossip?

37:37.160 --> 37:38.320
Leshan.

37:39.160 --> 37:40.560
- Leshan.
- Mother.

37:40.640 --> 37:42.240
Just let him.

37:42.320 --> 37:44.120
Mother, how did you come here?

37:44.200 --> 37:45.640
I asked Fuhui to attend the business.

37:45.720 --> 37:48.840
My son-in-law is competing.
How could I not come to cheer him on?

37:48.920 --> 37:50.480
Leshan.

37:50.560 --> 37:52.920
In Bianjing, women who are at the helm

37:53.000 --> 37:54.800
and start business are no less.

37:54.880 --> 37:56.560
We are not afraid of their mockery.

37:56.640 --> 37:58.600
Besides, your husband has let you go.

37:58.680 --> 38:00.000
Why fear what others might say?

38:06.440 --> 38:07.600
Everyone, compete well for me.

38:08.200 --> 38:11.200
Today, if anyone put on a pitiful face,
I will knock them out.

38:11.960 --> 38:14.840
Good.

38:14.920 --> 38:16.760
Good.

38:19.440 --> 38:20.560
Mother.

38:20.640 --> 38:23.720
This time, our Li family will make
a great name for ourselves in Bianjing.

38:23.800 --> 38:24.640
Just right.

38:24.720 --> 38:28.360
Let all Bianjing see the fine demeanor
of the Li family's daughter.

38:28.440 --> 38:29.760
Put those men to shame.

38:29.840 --> 38:31.120
Good.

38:31.200 --> 38:34.200
Good.

38:35.680 --> 38:36.840
Well…

38:36.920 --> 38:38.440
Qiongnu, let's go.

39:02.200 --> 39:04.520
- Why is there a lady playing the drum?
- Exactly.

39:04.600 --> 39:06.920
That's my daughter.

39:07.680 --> 39:08.560
Leshan.

39:09.320 --> 39:11.640
How come your Yang family
also has ladies entering the arena?

39:16.640 --> 39:18.360
Oh brother.

39:18.440 --> 39:20.560
How dare you act recklessly
in the imperial presence?

39:41.440 --> 39:43.160
Truly formidable.

41:21.000 --> 41:23.120
Yang Xian.

41:32.800 --> 41:33.760
He is back.

41:33.840 --> 41:36.200
Good.

41:36.280 --> 41:38.960
Bravo.

41:39.040 --> 41:41.560
Keep it up.

41:43.600 --> 41:45.160
My lord, hurry.

41:47.320 --> 41:50.160
Go on. Go on.

41:50.240 --> 41:51.080
My lord.

41:51.840 --> 41:53.280
Is everything ready?

41:53.360 --> 41:54.720
It's been ready for a while.

41:59.920 --> 42:01.880
Don't blame me for being heartless.

42:01.960 --> 42:03.920
Why not just accept your fate

42:04.000 --> 42:06.200
and spend a lifetime
as a good-for-nothing?

42:20.160 --> 42:22.120
My lord, be careful.

42:29.160 --> 42:31.320
Charge.

42:31.400 --> 42:33.240
Just a little bit more.

43:00.560 --> 43:01.640
Yang Xian.

43:01.720 --> 43:02.960
Be careful.

43:16.600 --> 43:18.200
So close.

43:23.680 --> 43:24.680
Be careful.

43:26.760 --> 43:28.240
Got it.

43:28.320 --> 43:30.480
I won.

43:30.560 --> 43:32.040
Wonderful.

43:32.120 --> 43:34.360
It's my son-in-law.

43:34.440 --> 43:36.280
My son-in-law is so formidable.

43:36.360 --> 43:37.680
Nice.

43:41.240 --> 43:42.280
Good.

43:46.680 --> 43:49.720
Leshan, I won!

43:54.120 --> 43:55.400
Well done.

43:56.720 --> 43:57.720
Well done.

44:04.080 --> 44:05.960
Truly good.

44:06.040 --> 44:11.720
Bravo.

44:18.760 --> 44:19.840
I'm coming.

44:21.320 --> 44:22.680
My lord, slow down.

44:23.520 --> 44:25.480
- Slow down, my lord. Are you alright?
- Yang Xian.

44:25.560 --> 44:26.760
How is it?

44:30.400 --> 44:32.080
- I'm fine.
- This is murder.

44:32.160 --> 44:33.640
They've committed murder.

44:33.720 --> 44:35.080
- Arrest them.
- Are you alright?

44:35.160 --> 44:36.240
Dare to harm my son-in-law.

44:36.320 --> 44:37.160
It's him.

44:37.240 --> 44:38.440
- What are you doing?
- Catch him.

44:38.520 --> 44:39.360
- It's him.
- Let me go.

44:39.440 --> 44:41.240
- It was you. I saw it.
- Who saw it?

44:41.320 --> 44:42.440
Who saw it?

44:42.520 --> 44:44.600
Clearly, it was your son-in-law.
He kicked me down.

44:44.680 --> 44:46.840
Yes, it was him
who caused us to lose the target.

44:46.920 --> 44:48.080
You pay.

44:48.160 --> 44:49.040
I'll hit you.

44:49.120 --> 44:50.160
Hit you.

44:50.240 --> 44:51.640
The shrew is hitting people.

44:51.720 --> 44:52.840
Take this.

44:53.680 --> 44:54.880
The shrew is hitting people.

44:54.960 --> 44:57.280
Which family's fierce lady are you,
playing tough?

44:58.000 --> 44:59.680
Others want to seize the mark.

44:59.760 --> 45:01.680
But they are bent on taking your life.

45:02.440 --> 45:05.360
Just now, from below,
I saw a flash of silver on his shoe.

45:05.440 --> 45:06.280
Something's fishy.

45:07.120 --> 45:08.160
Take him down.

45:09.480 --> 45:10.760
You wronged me.

45:10.840 --> 45:13.080
- The Yang family is bullying others.
- Take it easy.

45:13.160 --> 45:14.440
Take it slow.

45:14.520 --> 45:15.960
Please hear me out.

45:16.040 --> 45:18.440
Let go first.

45:20.640 --> 45:22.120
Xian.

45:22.200 --> 45:24.760
His Majesty graces
the grand event at Jinming Pool.

45:24.840 --> 45:26.840
This fighting and brawling of yours

45:26.920 --> 45:27.880
is a serious crime.

45:28.640 --> 45:30.400
Dishonoring the court adds to the offense.

45:30.480 --> 45:32.400
While His Majesty
has not yet passed sentence,

45:32.480 --> 45:34.880
I hope you will think thrice
before acting.

45:34.960 --> 45:37.040
Do not make it difficult for Jieyu.

45:37.120 --> 45:40.240
It is precisely because it's in front
of His Majesty, under the bright heavens,

45:40.320 --> 45:42.880
that we must expose
those evil spirits in their true form.

45:43.480 --> 45:44.480
Quick, pull off his boots.

45:46.160 --> 45:47.440
Let go of me.

45:51.440 --> 45:53.040
Look.

45:54.720 --> 45:55.800
Everyone, look.

45:55.880 --> 45:57.440
Indeed, a sharp blade is hidden.

45:57.520 --> 45:59.240
This is attempted murder. Look.

46:00.640 --> 46:01.600
What?

46:05.840 --> 46:06.840
Hold him down.

46:06.920 --> 46:08.640
All evidence says you're guilty.
You still run.

46:10.280 --> 46:11.560
By His Majesty's words,

46:11.640 --> 46:14.160
summon the Yang couple for questioning.

46:17.800 --> 46:18.920
Yes.

46:22.240 --> 46:23.640
What did I say?

46:23.720 --> 46:25.840
This is His Majesty deciding your crime.

46:26.440 --> 46:28.320
It's better to keep the peace
and appease people.

46:28.400 --> 46:30.200
Alright, disperse now.

46:30.800 --> 46:33.240
You are all young lords
with impetuous energy.

46:33.320 --> 46:35.440
That's why there was an uproar.
Both sides are at fault.

46:35.520 --> 46:38.760
The fault does not lie with one alone.
My brother is always rash.

46:39.440 --> 46:40.480
I apologize for him.

46:40.560 --> 46:42.680
I apologize on his behalf to everyone.

46:42.760 --> 46:45.960
Let's downplay the issue
and value harmony.

46:46.040 --> 46:47.400
How dare you…

46:50.360 --> 46:53.480
defend the murderer? Isn't that equivalent
to being an accomplice?

46:53.560 --> 46:55.040
I'm going to see His Majesty.

46:55.120 --> 46:57.000
I'll settle the score with you
once I return.

46:59.400 --> 47:01.200
My lady, let's go.

47:06.240 --> 47:07.320
Come on.

47:11.320 --> 47:13.280
You foolish thing.

47:13.360 --> 47:14.840
All my good intentions are wasted.

47:14.920 --> 47:16.280
You don't know what's good for you.

47:16.360 --> 47:18.120
You don't stand up for your family,

47:18.200 --> 47:19.800
you argue in defense of the assailant.

47:20.440 --> 47:21.600
Fortunately, it was in public.

47:21.680 --> 47:23.760
You still wish to
muddle truth with falsehood.

47:23.840 --> 47:24.960
- You…
- What are you saying?

47:25.040 --> 47:29.080
You're like a monkey showing off your
climbing skills, unaware of your flaws.

47:29.160 --> 47:30.880
Let's see if he turns red or not.

47:30.960 --> 47:32.760
I see it.

47:32.840 --> 47:34.240
Making a fool of himself.

47:34.840 --> 47:37.520
- Blushing furiously.
- No laughing allowed.

47:38.240 --> 47:39.640
Stop laughing.

47:39.720 --> 47:41.400
What are you laughing at?

47:43.640 --> 47:44.840
You.

47:44.920 --> 47:46.720
Harmony is precious.

50:22.720 --> 50:26.840
Subtitle translation by: Zhong Wenlong
